{"time": 1765441228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022908648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={340244F5-8C87-EECB-00B9-7B020CEB7666}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-340244F58C87EECB00B97B020CEB7666/0,file_size=2641]"}
{"time": 1765441229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637874975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "时间回到现在，梅梅窝在你的怀里"}
{"time": 1765441254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985442888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有多久才到啊....小卡，这空间好小”"}
{"time": 1765441312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506620459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该快了?\"推开车窗看看外面"}
{"time": 1765441400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311671941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己往角落挤一挤，给梅丹佐更多的空间，\"待会下车之前，梅梅变成人形吧，这样太引人注目了。\""}
{"time": 1765441407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576898033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还是林子，一眼望去没有城镇的影子，只有一片绿油油的林海"}
{"time": 1765441482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320510217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？那我现在就变成人形好了...可以更好的抱住小卡”随后便变成人形，自然而然的抱住了你"}
{"time": 1765441484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804964221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:image,file={8A32E307-2433-DB71-FB40-022819A0A2E3}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-8A32E3072433DB71FB40022819A0A2E3/0,file_size=10440]虽然不信这个）"}
