{"time": 1765441608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764933700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那个阿什么）"}
{"time": 1765441639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518137607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（阿斯莫蒂斯）"}
{"time": 1765441687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394863103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1320510217]摸摸她的头发，和梅梅在一起的时候，自己还算能克制那些虐杀的黑暗欲望，心情也能平静一些，\"还在林子里诶...真远啊。\""}
{"time": 1765441722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529830813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了....和小卡在一起倒也无所谓啦...”"}
{"time": 1765441764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226152162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你的新背景写的怎么样了）"}
{"time": 1765441841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46090266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就，故地重游然后发现一封姗姗来迟的信吧。从那个镇子寄到家族旧址的，然后就去寻求依靠什么的）"}
{"time": 1765441903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168615782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那这部分就省略了（bushi））"}
