{"time": 1765441919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727583142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(老镇民小格"}
{"time": 1765441928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76671919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我只想知道那个镇子大概邪恶人和善良人占几成）"}
{"time": 1765441949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407593178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不好说）"}
{"time": 1765441980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043794412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还好有梅梅在啦。\"靠着她闭目养神，\"到了那地方，估计有得忙活，梅梅也多休息一会。\""}
{"time": 1765442006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426608903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（或者说，有没有哪边压倒性地更多？）"}
{"time": 1765442008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210524707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...”你们一龙一人相互依偎着很快便睡着了"}
{"time": 1765442020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682253913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（决定我要不要装好人）"}
{"time": 1765442022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329425911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（明面上大家都是还信奉魔鬼的）"}
{"time": 1765442032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800023121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1765442036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353441931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是具体怎么想就是个人的事情）"}
{"time": 1765442221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123223661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我就不一样了，我不信魔鬼)"}
{"time": 1765442244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90977040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=2FC11FCBDE7EE9D806A740A3B9213C7E.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhThIOBo_v5pdJIysnZxIVdsNnQXfhibjQIg_woo-Zyl7pC1kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQsqOK1rX8MtFpLMyeiD4GqXoCLFmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMFbnRUufjv1VgomZvTbat1CsNsxL0og7dV0-H3VqNOyaQiiF_qSHzVH6VMOjSJjSJQ,file_size=34459]"}
{"time": 1765442322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124251738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "格蕾西亚自从收到那封信之后，来长野已经快两年了，这里虽然名义上还属于特鲁恩家族，但是经常听到一些奇奇怪怪的讨论，傍晚大家吃完饭，就开始聊天聊地，一会抨击这个，一会抨击那个，有时候连特鲁恩家族都敢讨论，尤其是最近闹得沸沸扬扬的光复骑士事件之后，对特鲁恩与魔鬼交易卖国求荣，类似的争论似乎越来越多了"}
{"time": 1765442390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293664788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以给一下自己的看法）"}
{"time": 1765442474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744609534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“骑士团也就剩点嘴皮子功夫了，谁知道这些墙头草里有没有收了那些伪君子好处的人？”"}
{"time": 1765442500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477109917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那光之剑是不是，玉玺）"}
{"time": 1765442512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005487174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（恭喜大家长可以称帝了）"}
{"time": 1765442525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285619322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（倒也并非是你在和别人的争论，应该是一种设定的补足（））"}
{"time": 1765442540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750502450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就当我和别人说过这句话）"}
{"time": 1765442545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061135028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1765442817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086612601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之你对那些老兵并没有什么好脸色，偶尔也会和伙伴去对他们做一些过分的事情，虽然做这种事不是很符合你的性格，不过他们毕竟他们先做的冒犯之举"}
{"time": 1765442873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901283953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这天，你刚刚睡醒，大概九点左右，就听到了一阵敲门声"}
{"time": 1765442888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420223491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我一个人住吗）"}
{"time": 1765442912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101639201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大概吧，可能是那个亲戚给你找了个房子住）"}
{"time": 1765442930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109695405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后自己搬走了这一块）"}
{"time": 1765442965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245387956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "懒得特意打扮，搓了搓脸就去开门"}
{"time": 1765443162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145257328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "打开门，正是你的好伙伴，西姆莉，她在长野镇经常做各种各样勾当，而你每次报复老兵时也总会找上她一起“刚睡醒？怎么睡这么久，我还以为你被人报复拖走了呢”她说话一向比较尖酸"}
{"time": 1765443325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926484458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以老兵都是外地人，不信魔鬼的居多？）"}
{"time": 1765443348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634648929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他们是战败方）"}
{"time": 1765443411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157457685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（之前王国发生了内战，他们是保皇派，然后特鲁恩家族召唤魔鬼，打败了他们和其他竞争者）"}
{"time": 1765443429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512095500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后战败俘虏之后没杀。给流放到这里了）"}
{"time": 1765443450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451386773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后也有那种信魔鬼的本地人）"}
{"time": 1765443483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221928060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（统治当地的家族本来有三家，两家保皇，一家魔鬼，然后保皇的被铲除了）"}
{"time": 1765443549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221255827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“拖走了不就拖走了，也不稀奇。”翻个白眼“不差这一笔账。有事？”"}
{"time": 1765443608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008060456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你这么能干，我可不舍得”对方浮夸的说到，随后又顾作神秘“有个大活，要干吗？”"}
{"time": 1765443647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963137997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“进来说吧”给她把门让开"}
{"time": 1765443661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789830671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我接到之后第一个就想到了你，够义气吧”"}
{"time": 1765443698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221685379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然，下次我有大活也找你”"}
{"time": 1765443732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568744676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用进去了，我现在只能给你说个大概，具体的等下午了你来酒馆找我吧，到时候我顺便给你介绍一下一起行动的另一个伙伴”"}
{"time": 1765443763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389531586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，那我就先听个大概”"}
{"time": 1765443874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088972125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“罗斯里克皮革厂你知道吧，咱们这个镇子上还算比较好的产业，我们去哪里偷个东西”"}
{"time": 1765443885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452145140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“或者说...抢劫”"}
{"time": 1765443932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351235947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“应该不是只为了钱吧”*两臂抱在胸前"}
{"time": 1765443984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641320765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当然...我们这次是帮一个大人物做事，至于是谁，我卖个关子”对方露出贱贱的笑容"}
{"time": 1765444126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014986681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是帮那帮蒙了心的人做事就行。希望有点眼熟，不然你也不会特意跑一趟过来吧”点点头“那下午见”"}
{"time": 1765444171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "918787774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我你还信不过吗，相信我就好了”西姆莉拍了拍你的肩膀“那我们下午见啦”"}
{"time": 1765444186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830380558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点意思（））"}
