{"time": 1765455915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715142416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是哪找来的帮手？感觉不太聪明的样子”把卡提希娅上半身放到床上"}
{"time": 1765455928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655742821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1086098724]（不会特意提是过继的吧）"}
{"time": 1765455955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687301987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还记得我之前说的那个大人物吗，好像是有人向他推荐的，就说让我去看看”"}
{"time": 1765455996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634925751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(应该不会提，但是都戴那么久了)"}
{"time": 1765456016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131831723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可能有个手链在手上。挂个玉牌之类的。)"}
{"time": 1765456016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102417692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没事，我也不一定认识）"}
{"time": 1765456054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625439175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主要是不想这么早认出来，很尴尬）"}
{"time": 1765456072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629728143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可以假装没认出来。)"}
{"time": 1765456081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718679791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=687301987]“好像不太符合期望，算了不管了，说说晚上的事吧”"}
{"time": 1765456087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998702646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们这平常都没什么外地样式的马车，她过来了也不下车，我叫住她还不理我”"}
{"time": 1765456125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610464583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1718679791]“不急....我有点想拿水把她泼醒，你怎么看”"}
{"time": 1765456173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943596328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这么快泼得醒吗）"}
{"time": 1765456190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881861895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打的非致命伤害（）"}
{"time": 1765456216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919933920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我没意见，别弄湿我的床就行”"}
{"time": 1765456309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447284513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(醒了就会委屈巴巴，人生地不熟突然被叫名字，还要骂哑巴，虽然做错了，但是被打的疼死了，还要被泼水。)"}
{"time": 1765456340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634461237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“把她带到外面吧，这样连你的地板都不会弄脏”"}
{"time": 1765456385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004322017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，好麻烦”她去接了半盆水"}
{"time": 1765456397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509467003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=447284513]（你是来应聘的，不叫你名字叫什么）"}
{"time": 1765456423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507446261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后直接抱着卡缇希亚，把她头闷进水里"}
{"time": 1765456506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83109887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“酷”"}
{"time": 1765456553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102819233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 你忽然感觉到一阵窒息感，随后惊醒了过来，发现自己头被按在了水里"}
{"time": 1765456592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132315307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咕...咕...\"剧烈挣扎起来，猛呛水，几乎要喘不过气了，双手使劲扒拉旁边的东西"}
{"time": 1765456614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297549901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但你的手被绑了起来，所以你没办法挣扎"}
{"time": 1765456662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441476703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈，格雷西亚你看她....”一想到你刚刚嚣张的样子，西姆莉就忍不住笑了出来"}
{"time": 1765456725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461527292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉我好邪恶）"}
{"time": 1765456780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413728158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "力气越来越小，本来就是重伤昏迷，\"...\"动静也越来越小，好像真的要死了...眼前似乎出现了苍姬女士..."}
{"time": 1765456792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917292291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“咳，算了算了”自己也莫名有一种喘不上气的感觉，走到她旁边站着“总有一种既视感。”"}
{"time": 1765456845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863194894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧，好吧，卡提西亚你要记住哦，这位格雷西亚可是你的救命恩人”随后她松手，把你重新放到了床上"}
{"time": 1765457004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452460863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眼前的视野里残留着大量的黑色斑影，就算被放出来，也只能有气无力地咳水，耳朵嗡嗡地。"}
{"time": 1765457117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383307873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们两先聊一下稍微熟悉一下，我去给她们买点吃的去...”"}
{"time": 1765457139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801089358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么是我们两个聊啊）"}
{"time": 1765457158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035996618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为你们晚上大概率要一起行动）"}
{"time": 1765457200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782263581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那她是项目负责人啊，她怎么能走）"}
{"time": 1765457214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300153790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她又不是不回来）"}
{"time": 1765457220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235502542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她可能是叫你和我自我介绍)"}
{"time": 1765457250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105411605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且她在可能会激起逆反情绪）"}
{"time": 1765457272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469372144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但你四舍五入算她救命恩人，所以可以稍微让她不会那么应激）"}
{"time": 1765457395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752203253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“卡提西亚是吧？名字没记错的话”先从她身上把匕首翻出来，插在桌上"}
{"time": 1765457408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923064297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后西姆莉就出门了"}
{"time": 1765457465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982058092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低着头，不停小声咳嗽，看看梅梅在哪，护在她身边，不想看眼前的人，\"咳...咳咳...你们一伙的...\""}
{"time": 1765457488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293474804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅被随手扔在地上，还在昏迷"}
{"time": 1765457574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497626903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不是还被绑着么）"}
{"time": 1765457584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096530306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只能当区蠕动）"}
{"time": 1765457615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114858317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你该向她展示你的仁之剑和义之剑了）"}
{"time": 1765457689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539980689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(蠕到她身边吧，而且被绑着也抬不了头)"}
{"time": 1765457733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654321223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“错了，只有你们俩自己是一伙的。大老远跑过来，刚下车就给雇主一个下马威？你知道长野镇是什么地方么？”"}
{"time": 1765457910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045332998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"有气无力，确认好梅梅没事，才慢慢开口\"...我怎么知道...你也说大老远...哪有突然喊我名字的...还骂人哑巴...\""}
{"time": 1765458033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137531422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在你知道了。搞不明白，叫下你的名字怎么了？”翻个白眼“觉得自己出名到除了雇主还有人认识你？”"}
{"time": 1765458300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832332140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"吸着鼻子，\"怎么这样...?我都不知道什么雇主。\"有点委屈，身上的伤口也痛的厉害，发出嘶嘶的声音。"}
{"time": 1765458369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620935385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你不知道？那你来这干嘛？”觉得对方不太像在说实话"}
{"time": 1765458671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165247029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对方跟我说...叫我来这边...找西姆莉...然后...可能会被大人物看上...\"说话断断续续，\"我不知道...\""}
{"time": 1765458842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267698482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦”一屁股坐回沙发上“那很难了，刚刚那位就是西姆莉”"}
{"time": 1765459003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620927356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”停了一会才开口，“你是谁？为什么...安排你来审我...”"}
{"time": 1765459257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314680730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她朋友”稍微有点兴致缺缺，怎么这人突然不轴了？“你这人好没劲，别人没惹你，你倒先动手了。现在被打过一顿，倒是软得很快嘛。”"}
{"time": 1765459275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786458206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还是说，你的脑袋里已经在偷偷琢磨怎么报复了？”"}
{"time": 1765459443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317212068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...和你，有什么关系...反正你们是一伙的...”今天算是认栽了，“我怎么都行...你们放了梅梅...她没动过手..”"}
{"time": 1765459549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274591632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她表里有脱困指令吗）"}
