{"time": 1765470068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200189617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己倒也没有纠结梅梅的吃相，在一旁坐下来，顺便吃一点点。"}
{"time": 1765470256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436873207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉倒是没说什么“这段时间她先住你家里？你那个远房亲戚给你留的房子蛮大的么”"}
{"time": 1765470416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302849914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔唔...\"自己其实不想和这家伙住在一起...尤其是，这家伙还跟自己长得很像...\"唉..只能住在这吗？\""}
{"time": 1765470472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123208166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你身上有多余的钱的话，帮你找地方我也无所谓...”西姆莉摆了摆手"}
{"time": 1765470574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036056275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...我有刚刚结余的8金币。”"}
{"time": 1765470680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222118457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"金币足够吗...\"自己知道可能不太够，但是就要先问问。"}
{"time": 1765470734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883251164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“请我帮忙可是很贵的，你要是真想的话，明天结算完报酬之后，我们在讨论吧...不过我觉得相比你的意见，格蕾西亚的意见大概更重要一些”"}
{"time": 1765470806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862317155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还没好？）"}
