{"time": 1765506686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498546930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "按掉闹钟，坐了起来，看了看时间，拍了拍脸，先把护具穿上"}
