{"time": 1765506780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736268735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅也被那声音吵醒了，用自己的小短手伸了个懒腰，随后变成了人的模样"}
{"time": 1765506933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024718740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "到客厅找点饼干，简单吃点，不至于打起来低血糖就好了"}
{"time": 1765506952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914543813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"捞起梅梅，带着浓厚的起床气从床上爬起来，简单穿上装备，一脚踢开房门，\"你好烦啊，睡觉了还不安生。\""}
{"time": 1765506962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932606682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对着大厅里的某人开口"}
{"time": 1765506977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332353183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为你穿的法师护甲（））"}
{"time": 1765507107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481442702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”瞥她一眼，不是很想理她，再嚼一口"}
{"time": 1765507174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370905533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"喂?聋子吗？哑巴吗?\"走到她面前，虽然稍微矮了半个头，但是气势不减，\"要我教你怎么说话?\""}
{"time": 1765507318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276711898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅也站在小卡身边，为她撑气势"}
{"time": 1765507368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331830667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“跟你说话感觉会被传染”咽下一口碳水，皱了皱眉“干好你的活，准时起床是基本”"}
{"time": 1765507513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027488163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧。\"不满地咂咂嘴，朝对方伸手，\"吃的，给我。\""}
{"time": 1765507598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847055593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "把手上省的半袋直接丢给她，去拿自己的长刀"}
{"time": 1765507603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675953241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（剩）"}
{"time": 1765507742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331227976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"切。\"接过来放到梅梅怀里，自己随便拿几块，不紧不慢地嚼嚼，\"反正也没什么好准备的，走呗。\""}
{"time": 1765507812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922431988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡，我能吃吗”梅梅看着怀里饼干，又看看你"}
{"time": 1765507970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874430606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实野太刀要拔刀斩，其实挺难的，吧）"}
{"time": 1765507976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865877409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然，我可能是，怪物猎人）"}
{"time": 1765508029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196725406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(hh"}
{"time": 1765508065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690219557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=922431988]\"诶?为什么这么问。\"摸摸她的脑袋，\"都放在梅梅怀里了诶，这坏女人还能不让我们吃不成。\""}
{"time": 1765508174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176826356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"谢谢小卡，谢谢坏女人\"说完便快速拿起一片饼干塞进嘴里"}
{"time": 1765508305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707235254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是撒糖霜的种类）"}
{"time": 1765508350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972012040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"都是梅梅的。\"宠溺地摸摸她的脑袋，转头看向格雷西亚，换回冷漠的表情，\"还杵着干嘛？你不是准时吗？\""}
{"time": 1765508384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634587055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我现在砍他一刀算不算突袭（））"}
