{"time": 1765508600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932461376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼——\"拖着长音，带着梅梅跟在后面。"}
{"time": 1765508616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821231413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "去皮革厂"}
{"time": 1765508621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970175738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（浙江温州浙江温州）"}
{"time": 1765508713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656552421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你们简单准备了一下，随后星夜前往了皮革厂"}
{"time": 1765508761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463836362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "关羽之歌"}
{"time": 1765508811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828984218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "長野鎮坐落於默語森林的邊緣。星星點點的亮光閃爍在門窗和街道上，偶爾還能從敞開的大門中聽到人們談笑風生的隻言片語，但是在鎮子的郊外，漆黑的夜晚格外安靜。稀疏的雲朵漂浮在空中，時不時遮蔽住月亮散發出的微光。繁星點點的夜空下，一片矮小的灌木叢後面黑壓壓地聳立著一片堡壘一般的建築群，而在那灌木丛边上，西姆莉也在那里等着你们"}
{"time": 1765508891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670613740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=812A00A70B26A1C8A2AE1454A7B1C942.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ1feRABys7MKfXNNjFLxTOESJVaBjW8gkg_woo7MaEkom3kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQw5polN4ti2k2j08JdSl5bXoCC-eCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMERmGl3dX0si6cm7zw1cv2d7K2iwcpMbr8V2qwMULk4fnM-ZogZPYBPEATSd2yPh0g,file_size=162134]"}
{"time": 1765508947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527750089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梅梅...对自己用那个吧？\"凑到她耳边开口，情感链接指到了法师护甲。"}
{"time": 1765508991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82557700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，小卡需要吗”梅梅手上发出蓝光，随后身上也出现了一层淡淡的蓝光"}
{"time": 1765509026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78446515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她自己不是穿了甲）"}
{"time": 1765509056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358213836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我有甲)"}
{"time": 1765509061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577065259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(待会给我上护盾术就行了)"}
{"time": 1765509073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538703119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦，我好像今天就准备一个法甲...”梅梅后知后觉的想了起来"}
{"time": 1765509080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396296478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1765509083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849527584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可能要问为什么护盾术能上给别人)"}
{"time": 1765509095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403779353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为魔宠？）"}
{"time": 1765509095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727814964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我知道你才是魔宠）"}
{"time": 1765509097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859578941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为我是魔宠共享法术)"}
{"time": 1765509111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606773433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是什么叫只准备了一个法甲）"}
{"time": 1765509124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773840858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一天就三个法术位)"}
{"time": 1765509124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664390824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是字面意思啊）"}
{"time": 1765509131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370140204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还能有多个吗)"}
{"time": 1765509138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798940456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来市区）"}
{"time": 1765509152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573894823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一环法师有什么好说的）"}
{"time": 1765509153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200859721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那她不进战还上什么，法甲）"}
{"time": 1765509160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612281970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1538703119]\"没关系啦。\"拍拍脑袋，\"待会给我用那个法术就好了。\""}
{"time": 1765509161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597744159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他可以扔油腻术啊）"}
{"time": 1765509165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971928837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她有手弩吗）"}
