{"time": 1765509556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984701214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这个技能决定的是你们得到的关于皮革厂的情报）"}
{"time": 1765509562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162756612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无所谓...\"小声嘀咕一句，戴上自己的面具，给梅梅也戴一个。"}
