{"time": 1765510909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20656704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后你们四人平稳落地"}
{"time": 1765510946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932056055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "這個泥濘的場地上全都是車轍和令人惡心的污漬。旁邊則是成排裝滿污水的池子。每個池子上都淤積著無以名狀的厚厚污垢，還有一些半浸在污水中的皮革漂浮在裡面。這些骯髒的混合物散發著刺鼻的惡臭——一股由臭雞蛋、酸橙和更糟的東西組成的悶人瘴氣。"}
{"time": 1765510978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526620804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=3903103EEF9AD21AAE01797343A2E275.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRQpbCfh73zQ6HRRgam6fgdGDthcRjV7DMg_wookMTE9JC3kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ3ahMSt1RuFnR9Fs56xuQQHoCrOWCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMO0wT1879NEEHNqFAEX5OYjR9dnbj54SrubunfI4busejZ9HdwihBQ44j7PPfUbUwA,file_size=849493]除此之外，你们还看到有一只狗，在一个房间外酣睡"}
