{"time": 1765524166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020967224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很难看出来吗？”晃了晃手上的金属条“保持安静，管好嘴巴现在就滚”"}
