{"time": 1765532022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857538433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那里头是赃款，没有那个没法交差，任务就算失败了”"}
{"time": 1765532073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827618344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅搜着有些嫌弃的搜着罗斯里克的尸体，西姆莉也过来一起帮忙，最后找到了一把精制品重弩，一瓶治疗轻伤药水，一个爆雷石"}
{"time": 1765532082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002683283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "以及钥匙串"}
{"time": 1765532087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120939921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“光有800金币有什么用，花的出去吗？”"}
{"time": 1765532121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758022148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5721D0B32C34B20F468326D70DA31F55.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT4g_0Koy6mbnNXw1daxjor8dkcVhiKsAEg_woohvmV19-3kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9PNfNX7-eHsHK_Y8M9G4QnoCvgKCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMFpOfREKJROGrxTYRMg1IZB514-1Ceu30Z6XaGHM9y9RY6Vgr0a6CoooUYIwAoCNTQ,file_size=22538]"}
{"time": 1765532161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579804120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧，这个数额多少他又不知道。\"皱着眉，\"只是让你重复一遍，别搞得很清高。\"烦躁地抓了抓头发，把对方手里的摊子抢过来，手里的钱袋子扔回保险箱。"}
{"time": 1765532211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062681284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉有些犹豫，保险箱里的钱确实挺多的，很有吸引力"}
{"time": 1765532223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764471718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有交涉吗）"}
{"time": 1765532318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125609186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有啊)"}
{"time": 1765532322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203131784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我20个技能)"}
{"time": 1765532328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388319865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不知道什么技能是我没有的)"}
{"time": 1765532345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963738411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+8 交涉"}
{"time": 1765532345, "type": "reply", "message_id": "963738411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]使用[交涉]演奏出:[1D20+8={7}+8=15]"}
{"time": 1765532354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619054073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（rp一下）"}
{"time": 1765532372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096310463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1765532522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821422614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我看你也很在意吧？\"摘下面具透透气，装作不在意地打个哈欠，从钱袋子里捏出一个金币，手滑一般滚落在地，\"嗯～不小心手滑了呢。\""}
{"time": 1765532572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648608388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有什么事也出去了再说。而且那串钥匙才是重点吧”"}
{"time": 1765532594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925790033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你说的对...这里面钱确实很多，我们偷偷拿一些确实应该不会被发现...但也不能太多了，最多200，我们三个人分...”"}
{"time": 1765532623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371508199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1648608388]“钥匙我看了，是保险柜钥匙和门钥匙，我们用不上”梅梅补充道"}
{"time": 1765532761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940817519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼～\"把钱袋子扔给西姆莉，\"这还有其他东西吗？\""}
{"time": 1765532802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416551159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该没有了。我们先离开吧，治安官可能很快就来了”"}
{"time": 1765532878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273489776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啧……别影响我的前途啊”"}
{"time": 1765532988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62697670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在想分钱的时候）"}
{"time": 1765532998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056852659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要让龙吃经济吗）"}
{"time": 1765533006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702074221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（应该不让）"}
{"time": 1765533032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003478609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁管你?\"抱着毯子，走到梅梅身边，帮她擦擦手，\"手都弄脏了...\"一脸心疼。"}
{"time": 1765533077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123263134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系啦,对了，小卡刚刚受伤了对不对，我帮你吹吹...”她有些心疼的看着你"}
{"time": 1765533306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751016319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事，一点小伤。\"说着话瞥一眼刚刚倒在地上的某人，重新戴上面具，\"回去再说吧。\"不管另外两人，拉着梅梅出门准备离开"}
{"time": 1765533321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579377668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啧，我这可不卖后悔药”准备去开门"}
{"time": 1765533378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000610564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啦，别吵了，我觉得你们发挥都还可以，走吧，去灰屋，我们去见雇主”"}
{"time": 1765533398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405851339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以在哪（）"}
{"time": 1765533421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29130566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一刀爆砍12血吧（））"}
{"time": 1765533588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226515704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼...\"不置可否，但是还是带着梅梅跟着这家伙"}
{"time": 1765533801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153215673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "走在出去的路上“那些东西上大多都有罗斯里克的名字，就交给我来出手吧，不过这毕竟是赃物，还是有风险的，我会稍微抽成一点，最后算上任务的报酬，再算上用我的卷轴钱，卡提西亚你拿330，格蕾西亚拿300，有什么疑义吗”"}
{"time": 1765533852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378270132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，我没意见”"}
{"time": 1765534052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265327687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧。\"有些不爽，直接开口\"那梅梅呢？\""}
{"time": 1765534107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669319131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你一个人想拿两分钱？那你和车了两张卡有什么区别（）"}
{"time": 1765534158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680876211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟一开始我收到的要求里就没有说要把她带上，换言之，她是自愿来的”"}
{"time": 1765534235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718961440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且是你自己强烈要求要把她带上的吧，那她应该算你的部下，报酬当然是从你的那份里面算”"}
{"time": 1765534276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111028491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"和这家伙说不下去，\"那我要多拿点。\""}
{"time": 1765534411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805893035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，你早点不说，现在才说，等会我多帮你说点好话行不行，我不就不给那位大人讲，你见面就想捅我的事情了”"}
{"time": 1765534525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232609512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "瞪一眼这两人，暂时没开口，之前还把自己按在水里，冷笑一声。迟早要算上这笔账。"}
{"time": 1765534545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535032163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不过我有面具，他们也不知道我瞪了)"}
{"time": 1765534583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404793954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总之跟着走了"}
{"time": 1765534592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216921113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说荷兰下雪了）"}
{"time": 1765534649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982827644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的，我们第一章的第一part的第一节就结束了，休息一会，等下继续）"}
{"time": 1765534693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93273538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我还想着欧洲下雪不是很正常啊)"}
{"time": 1765534697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668270189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是河南)"}
{"time": 1765534706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642836390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(早该下了)"}
{"time": 1765534724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633823832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我已经创建了共享文档了）"}
{"time": 1765534877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188054075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说你还是没说你为什么喜欢杀人（））"}
{"time": 1765534908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564309625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（死亡是壮烈的一瞬）"}
{"time": 1765534945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913749344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为你是千年越，所以杀人取乐？）"}
{"time": 1765534982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441393898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但人家杀人也有接口啊，还说什么把生命献给发疯的精魂，说不定能找到关闭世界之伤的方法）"}
{"time": 1765535053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816359410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（没什么理由啊）"}
{"time": 1765535080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359906262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={0DF6A337-6737-97D2-3EF2-D8ED117E570B}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-0DF6A337673797D23EF2D8ED117E570B/0,file_size=11408]"}
{"time": 1765535139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280011629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是心理上来说一般人是先决定自己喜欢什么才去找对应的信仰的（）"}
