{"time": 1765542273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956925340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们跟着西姆莉在林间穿行"}
{"time": 1765542350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654692172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是太守序了）"}
{"time": 1765542543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656846498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "来到了小镇西北一座被称为灰屋的建筑，当年长野有四大家族，两个家族支持皇权，一个家族支持特鲁恩，一个保持中立，在特鲁恩家族夺权后，那两大家族便消失了，而中立的莫拉加塔利家族，也在一场被烧死了大部分的成员的的未知原因大火后，一蹶不振，他们的土地也被不断送给了支持特鲁恩的费克斯家族....而这座灰屋便是当时莫加塔利家族的遗址，普通长野居民一般都不敢来这个地方"}
{"time": 1765542562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43829458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=654692172] （你不就是守序善么）"}
{"time": 1765542579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221317438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1765542586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206194173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我守序恶啊）"}
{"time": 1765542591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170260868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（说错了）"}
{"time": 1765542596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419463433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你不就是守序恶么）"}
{"time": 1765542621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571034224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "這座莊園的遺跡貌似隨時都可能崩塌一般。幾十年前大火的痕跡仍然歷歷在目，燒焦的房屋無法支撐三樓塌陷後的重量凹陷了下去。破碎的窗戶使得牆外的藤蔓毫無阻攔地爬滿每一處斷壁。彎曲的柱子和開裂的花崗岩門廊通向一扇早已扭曲的大門，一個佈滿鐵鏽的野豬頭門環孤零零地掛在門上。"}
{"time": 1765542621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220964612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（太守序了以至于看着不太恶）"}
{"time": 1765542626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187349967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，灰屋，我们到了”"}
{"time": 1765542630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023528856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我记得主要原因是我打不过龙）"}
{"time": 1765542646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001080179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（守序恶本来就是那种可以团结的（bushi））"}
{"time": 1765542673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987942256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（正义之怒里守序恶的地狱骑士也帮指挥官打圣战呢）"}
{"time": 1765542682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442411399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（混乱恶才是永远的敌人（）"}
{"time": 1765542688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185407738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一会看看这边有哪些序可以给我守）"}
{"time": 1765542801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062754676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大晚上来这种死人地方吗，真是……”耸耸肩“雇主和莫拉加塔利有关系？”"}
{"time": 1765542888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939397604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么问出这种话?\"面具之下翻个白眼，语气懒洋洋地，\"都说是特鲁恩牵线了。\""}
{"time": 1765542926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404327647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实，格蕾西亚还是多动动脑子吧，我们走？”"}
{"time": 1765543022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916244306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“天知道，走吧”"}
{"time": 1765543024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932954118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这家伙也就只有年龄大了，嘻嘻...\"回过头单手扬起面具轻蔑地冲她笑一笑，\"对吧？\""}
{"time": 1765543107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390781054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然有门，但门似乎被卡住了，不过西姆莉看样子经常来这里的样子，带着你们来到窗户处直接破窗而入"}
{"time": 1765543131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996216730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们跟紧我，稍微快一点”"}
{"time": 1765543155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239943830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“随你怎么想，风水轮流转，珍惜你还能威风的时间吧”不太理解怎么有人这么热衷于口舌之快"}
{"time": 1765543215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121510672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "翻窗！"}
{"time": 1765543248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596792995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（bin哥不喜欢别人评价他）"}
{"time": 1765543317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462799275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然外面看起来破破烂烂的，不过内部看起来非常稳固，没有坍塌的风险，她带着你们快速穿行，你们先经过了一个客厅，不过还没多多观察，她就领你们上了楼，来到一个锁着的门前"}
{"time": 1765543396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085485875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "她敲敲门，随后你们便听到了一个尖锐的男声，声音难以判断年龄，感觉听起来又老又年轻的“进来吧”"}
{"time": 1765543623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506677954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们进去吧...”西姆莉小声对你们说道"}
{"time": 1765543656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590241676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来都来了”"}
{"time": 1765543659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007223884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是不是锁着吗）"}
{"time": 1765543677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455520669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不管怎么听都是对方在狡辩，不知为何心情格外愉快，笑着尝试开门进去"}
{"time": 1765543686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12435432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之不知道是魔法还是什么，门一推就打开了"}
{"time": 1765543741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814523617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "幾個翻倒的書架、一張桌子和一些覆蓋著藤蔓的椅子讓這個房間看起來曾經是一個圖書館。灰燼和燒焦、浸水的書本混合成的泥漿，填充在牆壁前散落的家具間堆起了一個巨大的窩。一組紙屏風將房間隔成兩部分。一盞燈在另一側散發著搖曳的光芒，將一把高背椅和一張桌子的輪廓投射在輕薄的紙面上。"}
{"time": 1765543792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043958294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们进到房间之后，发现书架旁有一个窝，里面有一只骨面兽斑好奇的看的打量着你们"}
{"time": 1765543812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920570154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有一只什么？）"}
{"time": 1765543825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765271846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "与此同时，屏风后面的的光线逐渐增强，一个坐在桌子旁的光头人影映照了出来"}
{"time": 1765543842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810831431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=358A151D1B60A2BC963E78144B113268.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQdx8_ry_nZj9OGviVkyKLVtUL29xiB7wog_woozcj8q4u4kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQCP9zQ6FJvfYE25zli4oZgHoCp7aCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMFC5_-n3vADrbENAz2hJ8Px_nHjUr8_L1ULV1sPFIzlekbDrCpt6t1j5ojYIgwBhsQ,file_size=178049]（大概是这样）"}
{"time": 1765543916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617640599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=589B9C1D0C7B1232EEE3FB59E5B29DCA.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS6e4WUoqzvknyuDzRSvWKE1jvwlxi28Bkg_woo7siSz4u4kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQh1OzxLTS3whTYE59S7brUXoCPluCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMFC5_-n3vADrbENAz2hJ8Px_nHjUr8_L1ULV1sPFIzlekbDrCpt6t1j5ojYIgwBhsQ,file_size=423990]"}
{"time": 1765543922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96596634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骨面斑兽）"}
{"time": 1765543925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837565520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?\"颇为好奇地看着，凑到梅梅耳边，\"梅梅...侦查一下魔法。\""}
{"time": 1765543968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342113812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你有没有感觉到不太礼貌）"}
{"time": 1765543984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143245479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅使用了侦测魔法，然后小声告诉你“小卡，有魔法灵光的”"}
{"time": 1765544032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043263249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "里面那人也继续用自己又老又年轻的声音“西姆莉，事情办的怎么样”"}
{"time": 1765544050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041439179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉看了看你们三人，斟酌了一下发言"}
{"time": 1765544124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265614312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=342113812](我知道不太礼貌，但是这种人一般不会在意)"}
{"time": 1765544346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809081010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大人，我们任务完成的非常出色，我们四人深夜轻易就翻过了围栏，面对可能会阻拦计划的敌人，卡提西亚和格蕾西亚也一点没有手软，大人，你是不知道，格蕾西亚的拔刀剑有多么的帅，卡提西亚使用匕首的技巧也不在我之下...最后我们也是很顺利的完成了任务，为了防止有人泄露我们的行踪，卡提西亚甚至专门灭了那家伙的口...”西姆莉添油加醋的描写了你们的经历，关于你们表现不好的地方，比如卡提西亚情绪不太稳定，格蕾西亚被发现后把人放跑了也只字未提“这是我们搜到的钱...”西姆莉随后把钱袋放在屏风这一侧的桌子上"}
{"time": 1765544421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322407701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真厉害，口舌这方面自己大概拍马也赶不上吧”心里这么想着，不过嘴角多少有些挂不住"}
{"time": 1765544527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528619498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "反正戴着面具，倒是洋洋自得地挺着胸膛。"}
{"time": 1765544595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053594809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "神秘人直到听完了评价才开口“ 很好。你們幹得不錯，西姆莉，你和你的同夥聽起來很有潛力。你們可以去樓下的客廳拿報酬，每人還有一件額外的小禮物。去吧，好好慶祝和享受一番。這都是你們應得的。不久的將來還會有更多的工作要做。”"}
{"time": 1765544640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657307578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那大人，我就先走了...”西姆莉先一步去楼下了，留你们二人和那位神秘人独处"}
{"time": 1765544662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842993799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多些阁下给的机会，不知，阁下是哪位男爵？又或者是，伯爵？”看了看有点光秃秃的魔法兽，重新把目光放在人上"}
{"time": 1765544742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867860324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不不不，我只是一个生意人，对长野镇感兴趣的生意人...不过我确实有你说那些人的人脉，从高层到底层...”对方倒是也不吝惜回答你的问题"}
{"time": 1765544869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007505817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"自己倒是不怎么感兴趣，但是这个家伙没走，自己也不能先走了。在一旁站着没动"}
{"time": 1765545152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229926048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“人脉说不定比爵位更难得到呢。格蕾西娅，期待下一次效力的机会”右手放在胸前，微微躬身"}
{"time": 1765545235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004224605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在面具下翻个白眼，没有说话，感觉这人好无聊啊，拉着梅梅转身下楼"}
{"time": 1765545275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366600688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，那你们快去看看我给你们准备的奖励吧，相信你们会喜欢的”"}
{"time": 1765545351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288777865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多谢”也不在行冗余的礼节，下楼去了"}
{"time": 1765545485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697029574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们来到拉泽拉戈所说的客厅，发现西姆莉已经坐在桌子旁了，而桌子上则摆着各种各样的美食：8瓶西冠城出產的葡萄酒，一些新鮮的麵包，蒜味黃油以及各種熏製的魚和野豬肉。"}
{"time": 1765545501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162093718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉还没有吃，在等着你们一起"}
{"time": 1765545523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766380281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“快点快点，这些好东西我以前基本没怎么吃过”"}
{"time": 1765545669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173737207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是吃的?\"皱了皱眉"}
{"time": 1765545695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015945321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（典型的滥强思维（）"}
{"time": 1765545753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179547154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“急什么，先坐下啊...”她从下面掏出了一个大箱子，放在一旁的空地“你们快来看看吧，我也还没看，毕竟一起看感觉更有仪式感一点”"}
{"time": 1765545929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746845350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，这还差不多嘛。\"在箱子旁蹲下，回头看一眼刚下楼的家伙，甩甩脑袋。"}
{"time": 1765545935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880544837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*坐到桌边，既然有她开箱自己就先开上一瓶葡萄酒，给面包抹上蒜香黄油“倒是有段时间没吃夜宵了”"}
{"time": 1765546028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289201227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神你有没有偏好武器，还是你偏好武器就是那唐诗匕首）"}
{"time": 1765546041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487136662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是啊，)"}
{"time": 1765546046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430657268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(匕首有没有厉害点的)"}
{"time": 1765546129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184054794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不如要个魔杖（）"}
{"time": 1765546136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020551393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "卡提西亚率先打开箱子，西姆莉也在朝这边看着，里面最明显的就是有三把武器，一把精制品野太刀，两把精致匕首，当然这两把匕首是卡提西亚和西姆莉一人一把，随后还有三个钱袋，上面也标有姓名，但很明显，西姆莉的钱袋要比你们大上一圈"}
{"time": 1765546177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814894397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉眼疾手快，直接把属于自己的那份拿走了“这匕首不错啊，我喜欢”边喝酒边把玩"}
{"time": 1765546220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981324736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={4AE64709-8AA8-B93F-DD14-D71E51750FC0}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-4AE647098AA8B93FDD14D71E51750FC0/0,file_size=267045]"}
{"time": 1765546252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212765891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={97BB6D1C-C656-4A1A-FB8D-D4934B64509A}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-97BB6D1CC6564A1AFB8DD4934B64509A/0,file_size=68648]"}
{"time": 1765546257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187540881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（原来有这种神人东西）"}
{"time": 1765546272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189829593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（咦，如果龙神拿着野太刀，我是不是拿这个会相似一点）"}
{"time": 1765546394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835086694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1814894397]\"...\"戴着面具看不清表情，不满地咂咂嘴，拿走自己的东西。"}
{"time": 1765546428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504144744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就剩咱们三了，你那面具怎么还不摘下来，你准备带着面具吃饭吗”"}
{"time": 1765546453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867757195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来没有梅丹佐的份”拿走那把野太刀，出鞘半尺照照光"}
{"time": 1765546458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239141305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅已经坐到桌子前，期待的看着你"}
{"time": 1765546469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335456375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1867757195][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 当然是非常的精致"}
{"time": 1765546489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247090792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "比起什么钱啦武器啦，似乎这些吃的更吸引梅丹佐一些"}
{"time": 1765546946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573849058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504144744]摘下自己的面具，\"你们先吃。\""}
{"time": 1765546972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132178336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到你这样说了，梅梅也不客气，开始大快朵颐起来"}
{"time": 1765546978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421561571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1880544837]吃！两面包夹芝士猪排"}
{"time": 1765547276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619440282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "面包香香脆脆的，猪排汁水很足，用的调料也属于很好的那批，在加上黄油相辅相成，自从家庭发生变故以来，你已经很久没吃过这么好吃的饭了"}
{"time": 1765547350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859634433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "懒得计较口舌、声名、得失。错过一顿等一年，吃了再说"}
{"time": 1765547403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594978932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自从自己流浪以来...确实从未吃过这么好吃的饭菜了...忍不住多吃了一些，摸摸自己的小肚子"}
{"time": 1765547683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407032819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来，西姆莉，我还不知道他的名字呢”灌下一口葡萄酒，有些发涩，不为解渴，单纯是气氛到了"}
{"time": 1765547745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836948840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之前不是说过一次?\"没什么表情变化，\"拉泽拉戈。\""}
{"time": 1765547790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476436332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我居然已经习惯了，习惯你的犯蠢，真是可怕的事...\""}
{"time": 1765547817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366724879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来说过）"}
{"time": 1765547829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536174619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，健忘这块）"}
{"time": 1765547850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338651399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈哈...”西姆莉也忍不住嘲笑起来你"}
{"time": 1765548126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1444649617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”握着瓶子的手咣地掉在桌上，摇了摇头“原来说过，什么时候的事……算了”"}
{"time": 1765548251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465825315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我已经习惯了，所以不用多说了。和你在一起，都是正常的。\""}
{"time": 1765548291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450600885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今晚要不要留在这边休息，最近我基本一直待在这里的”"}
{"time": 1765548356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726751734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这时你们才有机会去看看这里的摆设，這裡到處都散落著破舊家具的碎片，塵土飛揚到令人窒息的地步。空威士忌瓶子丟了一地，壁爐有最近使用過的痕跡。那些被燒焦的小天使的破碎臉龐，好奇地從通向房子深處的拱道頂上方探了出來。"}
{"time": 1765548400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847761173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一代又一代的流浪者幾乎將大宅裡所有還算完整的家具都聚集在了這裡，南方廉價威士忌「老厄瑞波斯」的破碎棕瓶成了他們曾經留宿於此的\n標記。雖然談不上豪華，但客廳還算乾燥並且幾乎沒人會來打扰，這裡放了一盞油燈，壁爐前鋪有一張草墊"}
{"time": 1765548459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496726859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我又不是没地方住”*摇摇头，拎起第二瓶葡萄酒，准备带回家去喝"}
{"time": 1765548526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729133663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不要，我认床。\""}
{"time": 1765548550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766504967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？你不是才刚来么，认哪张床”"}
{"time": 1765548680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993169875", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天睡的床。\"戳戳还在进食的梅梅的肚子，软绵绵地，手感很高"}
{"time": 1765548684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天睡的床。\"戳戳还在进食的梅梅的肚子，软绵绵地，手感很好"}
{"time": 1765548699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265050057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我先声明，绝对不允许你再去我家”"}
{"time": 1765548805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467373697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡，好痒...”梅梅有点忍不住想笑"}
{"time": 1765548889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442798785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"干什么?\"皱着眉看着她，\"你家那么大，收留我怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1765548927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831403977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=467373697]停下手，\"嘛...多吃一点，之前都吃的不怎么好。\""}
{"time": 1765548943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633477495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不收，和你在一块呆久了脑子会有问题”"}
{"time": 1765548982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860519767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...”当然不用你说，梅梅也吃的很开心“小格，让我们住你家吧...好不好么”梅梅也用可怜的眼神向你撒娇"}
{"time": 1765549151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573344492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"瞪大眼睛，楚楚可怜地看着格雷西亚"}
{"time": 1765549352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349440122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不好，我家就我一个人，谁知道你们两个进来会干什么？”眯着眼睛看着这个长相让自己有点产生恐怖谷效应的脸"}
{"time": 1765549477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111900828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们，做客。\"说的理所当然，\"毕竟我们现在是一伙的，对不对?\"看向西姆莉。"}
{"time": 1765549510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479599120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "恶狠狠地瞪向西姆莉"}
{"time": 1765549581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153991088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看我干嘛啊？”西姆莉表示有些无辜“不过你们短时间确实要一起行动吧，多熟悉熟悉也比较好...而且在我看来，你们两个都不一般，以后发达了可要记得带我一把...”"}
{"time": 1765549635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206557424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你到底是哪边的？”不善地看着她“她自己找个别的地儿住有区别吗”"}
{"time": 1765549743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659672179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“随你们吧.. 反正我谁都惹不起”"}
{"time": 1765549804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795916473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"达咩。\"一副无赖的样子，\"你都这么像本小姐了，给本小姐提供个房间怎么了？\"好像有些说漏了嘴，带上了以前的自称，\"咳咳，反正，就这样。\""}
{"time": 1765549862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11723172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“西姆莉，私闯民宅怎么判？”"}
{"time": 1765549915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134655281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，实在不行，你就睡我这里吧...我最近天天睡这..很自在”"}
{"time": 1765550158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22029865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，雀占鸠巢）"}
{"time": 1765550162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845607241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是的，我怎么你了?\"指着自己，\"今天难道没有成事吗？\""}
{"time": 1765550172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085172623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=22029865]（说反啦）"}
{"time": 1765550261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604527487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这个我真的分不太清（）"}
{"time": 1765550274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485949124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(鸠占鹊巢)"}
{"time": 1765550294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550291381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行，你很危险”直截了当地说"}
{"time": 1765550390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349531949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我危险在哪?\"皱着眉，\"我对你做什么了吗？\""}
{"time": 1765550892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029108301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是我动）"}
{"time": 1765550986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044887041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可以啊，把武器全交给西姆莉保管，再把梅丹佐捆起来，就允许你们过夜”"}
{"time": 1765551064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062314892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"皱着眉，\"我们的安全都靠你了？\"眉头一转，\"行啊。\"轻盈地笑起来"}
{"time": 1765551112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844383839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”皱着眉看着她“不行，我改主意了。不管怎么样都不行，自己找别的地方住去”"}
{"time": 1765551197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604314634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我有必要害你吗？\"歪歪头"}
{"time": 1765551220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285565691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你很需要理由吗？”"}
{"time": 1765551367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914547519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大概还是要的吧？\"打个哈欠。"}
{"time": 1765551394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397457355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之不行，别让我再在我家看见你”"}
{"time": 1765551484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599974313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠近一些，眯着眼看着她，观察着和自己有几分相似的容貌，\"你...是不是?有些怕我?\""}
{"time": 1765551647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473224803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉饶有兴趣的在一旁看着"}
{"time": 1765551659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108950034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（对了，问一句，今晚有没）"}
