{"time": 1765551985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911304277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到底是什么意思?\""}
{"time": 1765552001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247008961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喜怒无常，像个疯子”*皱眉"}
{"time": 1765552164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504499736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"何意味?\"摇头，看向西姆莉，\"有吗？\""}
{"time": 1765552208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744021773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉并不想回答这种显而易见的问题，选择了喝酒"}
{"time": 1765552407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835147690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"反正，别管。\""}
{"time": 1765552424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501343736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别管是？）"}
{"time": 1765552503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145607467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你还不如撒撒娇）"}
{"time": 1765552537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727674534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "撒娇地看着格雷西亚"}
{"time": 1765553034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218012904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1765553101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907000136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……别拿那张脸做这种表情，很吓人”站起身来，拎着酒瓶往回走"}
{"time": 1765553222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993207201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就当你同意咯?\"拉起梅梅的胳膊，\"走咯，回去睡觉\""}
{"time": 1765553253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856609004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不同意，要我重复几次？”"}
{"time": 1765553429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802674325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无聊。\"皱着眉，拉着梅梅，\"那我们去哪?\"看向西姆莉"}
{"time": 1765553480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187441061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就睡这里呗....我去再去给你找点被褥之类的”"}
{"time": 1765553666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685089321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也行吧。\""}
{"time": 1765554227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678564935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就麻烦西姆莉咯?\"耸耸肩，\"而且，你不怕我吗？我看那家伙怕我怕的厉害。\"从腋下把梅梅抱起来，跟着西姆莉。"}
{"time": 1765554661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396241279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得你现在应该不会蠢到把我杀了”西姆莉说到，然后起身去一旁给你在壁炉旁再收拾出两个睡觉的地方"}
{"time": 1765554802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879438156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然你之前确实很冲动”"}
{"time": 1765555030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123531515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼，所以是谁的问题?\""}
{"time": 1765555236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230377117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那家伙是不是太不喜欢我了？\"指着自己。"}
{"time": 1765555346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413959002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不好说...你就别为难我了...要不要玩投飞镖？”"}
{"time": 1765555398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767297481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=856609004]“明天见，格蕾西亚”西姆莉跟你挥手告别"}
{"time": 1765555614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107468979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"切。\"打个哈欠，把梅梅放在壁炉边，接过飞镖在手中转悠，\"说起来，那家伙什么背景?\"皱着眉，还是疑惑对方的样貌。"}
{"time": 1765555685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556782093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你说拉泽拉戈大人？”她看你对扔飞镖好像蛮感兴趣的，便便布置，变和你聊天“你刚刚怎么不自己问他”"}
{"time": 1765555982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501483564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没必要，反正他是金主，他让我干什么，我照做就行。\"自己也坐下来，\"我是说，格雷西亚，这家伙。\"把飞镖扎在桌上，\"梅梅也感觉很奇怪吧？本小姐的弟弟都没这么像我。\""}
{"time": 1765556339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168404922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她能有什么背景，好像前两年才搬过来...好像这边亲戚给他留个个房子..他就来长野了”提到长野，西姆莉似乎着重强调了一下“真惨啊，来长野这种地方住，她来了之后，我看她身手还不错，就经常带她做一些事情，至于更详细的，我没问”"}
{"time": 1765556507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421991576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无聊的理由。\"摇摇头，表示自己不感兴趣了，\"飞镖?\"转转手上的飞镖"}
{"time": 1765556738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935136294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我先来吧!”"}
